{"ref":"BDB, חָסָה","hw":"חָסָה","html":"† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">חָסָה</span></big></big>  <strong>vb.</strong> (mostly poet. and fig.) <strong>seek refuge (</strong>Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">حَشِىَ</span> iii. is <em>set aside;</em> v. <em>go aside, apart;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">حَشًى</span> <em>shelter, protection;</em> but? ش = ס<strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 64:11\" href=\"/Psalms.64.11\">ψ 64:11</a>; 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">חָסָ֫יָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 57:2\" href=\"/Psalms.57.2\">ψ 57:2</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חָסִ֫יתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 7:2\" href=\"/Psalms.7.2\">ψ 7:2</a> + 7 times; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">חָסוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 37:40\" href=\"/Psalms.37.40\">ψ 37:40</a> <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 3:12\" href=\"/Zephaniah.3.12\">Zp 3:12</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חָסָ֫יוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:17\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.17\">Dt 32:17</a>; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יֶחְסֶּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 34:9\" href=\"/Psalms.34.9\">ψ 34:9</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">תֶחְסֶּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 91:4\" href=\"/Psalms.91.4\">ψ 91:4</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶחְסֶּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 57:2\" href=\"/Psalms.57.2\">ψ 57:2</a> (see Baer <a data-ref=\"Psalms 34:9\" href=\"/Psalms.34.9\">ψ 34:9</a>), <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶחֱסֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:3\" href=\"/Psalms.18.3\">ψ 18:3</a> + 2 times; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">יֶחֱסוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 14:32\" href=\"/Isaiah.14.32\">Is 14:32</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יֶחֱסָיוּן</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 36:8\" href=\"/Psalms.36.8\">ψ 36:8</a>; Imv. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲסוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:15\" href=\"/Judges.9.15\">Ju 9:15</a>; Inf. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲסוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 118:8\" href=\"/Psalms.118.8\">ψ 118:8</a> + 3 times; pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">חוֹסֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 57:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.57.13\">Is 57:13</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹסֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Prove